milestone AGENT_ACTION_PROPOSAL_ALIGNMENT_TRIAL_COMPLETED:
  title "Aligned action proposals released and observed before the next axial choice"

task T_BUILD_CAUSAL_TURN_SLICE MAIN_BASE_FIXED -> CAUSAL_SLICE_IMPLEMENTED:
  title "Build the owner-grounded causal turn receipt and narration projection"
  description "Add a pure shared BattleTurnCausalReceipt builder and an ID-free perspective-safe NarrationCausalProjection. Assemble only explicit current-main owner outputs after semantic reconciliation: requested and effective actions resolution outcome and reason sourceActionId-linked events validated committed mechanical evidence semantic apply status accepted change and bounded before-to-after carry-forward state. Missing links remain unknown and prose is never mined. Add focused schemas builders and tests; do not port the PoC five-artifact applicability bundle create persistence or generalize the world model."
  duration 2p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_WIRE_NARRATION_CONSUMER CAUSAL_SLICE_IMPLEMENTED -> FIRST_CONSUMER_IMPLEMENTED:
  title "Wire the causal projection into the existing narrator path"
  description "Construct the receipt in battle-service after semantic reconciliation and before buildNarrationTurnView then add the bounded causal projection to the existing narrator input behind a reversible default-off guard. Reuse the current narrator call and fallback; add no provider repository persistence or domain write and grant narration no action mechanics state winner rating or cognition authority."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_ACCEPT_CAUSAL_SLICE FIRST_CONSUMER_IMPLEMENTED -> LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_ACCEPTED:
  title "Accept the connected minimal pipeline before trial"
  description "Verify receipt derivation event and evidence linkage perspective filtering dangling-link refusal legacy fallback off-mode parity narrator-only authority and no added effectful calls. Run focused shared and backend tests full tests typecheck build git diff checks and both PERT checks. This accepts only the thin implementation concept and does not claim generalized pipeline correctness."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_TRY_AND_REVISE_STAGING LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_ACCEPTED -> STAGING_ITERATION_COMPLETED:
  title "Try the implemented causal pipeline and make one bounded revision"
  description "Deploy one accepted artifact to staging and run synthetic or disposable authenticated battles through baseline and guarded narration. Compare causal coherence concrete progression unsupported claims fallback privacy latency and cost then permit one bounded revision only to the receipt builder projection guard or narrator instruction followed by the same local gates and staging replay. Check open observation backlog items as secondary scorecards and retain any survivor without scheduling an automatic local fix."
  duration 2p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_DECIDE_PRODUCTION_TRIAL STAGING_ITERATION_COMPLETED -> PRODUCTION_TRIAL_DECIDED:
  title "Decide a bounded guarded production trial from staging evidence"
  description "Approved the exact v0.7.2 guarded artifacts for the current single-user full cohort: narration_guarded stays enabled at 100 percent with no cohort splitter. The prior v0.7.1 revision and Worker remain rollback targets. Production smoke unsupported factual claims privacy leakage mechanical divergence unexpected calls or rollback failure remain stop conditions. The decision grants no mechanical authority and does not authorize a backlog-driven patch queue."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "user"
  requires:
    OWNER 1

task T_TRY_GUARDED_PRODUCTION PRODUCTION_TRIAL_DECIDED -> PRODUCTION_TRIAL_COMPLETED:
  title "Run or record the guarded production trial disposition"
  description "Promote the accepted v0.7.2 causal narration projection enabled for the full current single-user cohort while preserving mechanics calls persistence and rollback. Verify the exact Cloud Run revision mode image and 100 percent traffic the exact Worker version production health authentication smoke release evidence and post-promote errors. Stop on unsupported factual claims privacy leakage mechanical divergence unexpected calls or rollback failure."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_CHOOSE_NEXT_PIPELINE_AXIS PRODUCTION_TRIAL_COMPLETED -> NEXT_HYPOTHESIS_SELECTED:
  title "Select the next axial and current-main-patchable hypothesis"
  description "Selected persistent E2E observation as the immediate enabling axis after the causal slice reached production. Preserve two dedicated cross-account E2E identities deterministic reusable characters battlefield and narration style and every resulting battle. Isolate their assets from general users while test E2E and administrator identities share the test realm. This enables repeated pipeline observations before choosing the next mechanics axis."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "user"
  requires:
    OWNER 1

task T_BUILD_PERSISTENT_E2E_REALM NEXT_HYPOTHESIS_SELECTED -> PERSISTENT_E2E_REALM_IMPLEMENTED:
  title "Build the persistent isolated E2E realm and observer"
  description "Add a server-owned general test and e2e account classification with fail-closed repository visibility. General users cannot discover test or e2e characters battlefields narration styles or rating population. Test and e2e identities share their realm and can run cross-account battles; administrators can access both. Add a persistent Codex observer runner that provisions or reuses two stable E2E identities deterministic fixtures and records a sanitized full-battle artifact without deleting the accounts assets or battle. Add focused migration auth repository runner and workflow tests."
  duration 3p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_RELEASE_PERSISTENT_E2E_REALM PERSISTENT_E2E_REALM_IMPLEMENTED -> PERSISTENT_E2E_REALM_RELEASED:
  title "Release the E2E realm and bind the production administrator"
  description "Release the accepted additive migration visibility boundary and observer image through the annotated tag Stage and protected Promote path. Bind ADMIN_EMAILS to mako10k@mk10.org in the staged and promoted Cloud Run revision and verify the exact environment without changing battle mechanics provider order or public traffic policy."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_RUN_FIRST_PERSISTENT_E2E PERSISTENT_E2E_REALM_RELEASED -> FIRST_E2E_OBSERVATION_RECORDED:
  title "Run and retain the first persistent cross-account E2E battle"
  description "Dispatch the protected observer against the exact guarded production revision. Reuse the Codex observer and opponent accounts fixtures battlefield and narration style run through authentication match creation SSE turn advancement and finish then retain the battle and sanitized artifact. Verify general realm exclusion test realm sharing administrator access no secret or raw mechanics leakage and no unexpected production errors."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_BUILD_AGENT_PIPELINE_DAG FIRST_E2E_OBSERVATION_RECORDED -> AGENT_PIPELINE_TRACE_VISIBLE:
  title "Persist bounded character and narrator I/O and render the internal DAG"
  description "For future turns retain the exact bounded server-built consumer input, provider disposition and output, and accepted output for Site A and Site B, plus the narrator call input and returned output. Store no provider credentials, transport headers, hidden chain of thought, or raw request envelope. Extend the existing separate internal observation API and Web screen with a per-turn DAG from both character contexts through outputs, adjudication, canonical transition, narrator input and public output. Older battles report trace unavailability honestly."
  duration 2p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_RESHAPE_NARRATOR_INPUT AGENT_PIPELINE_TRACE_VISIBLE -> NARRATOR_INPUT_RESHAPED:
  title "Reshape narrator input without constraining narrator output"
  description "Replace overlapping narration facts with one bounded turn brief that clearly separates committed action and consequence facts, accepted semantic or world change, current canonical conditions, and static battlefield flavor. Preserve perspective and identity boundaries and the existing single narrator call, but add no claim guard, prose validator, mechanical authority, retry policy, or narrator-output restriction. Add focused tests for information sufficiency, non-duplication, and empty-change clarity."
  duration 2p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_TRY_NARRATOR_INPUT_PIPELINE NARRATOR_INPUT_RESHAPED -> NARRATOR_INPUT_TRIAL_COMPLETED:
  title "Release and observe the agent DAG and reshaped narrator input"
  description "Run local acceptance then release the exact artifact through feature review, annotated tag, Stage and protected Promote. Execute the persistent cross-account E2E battle, inspect Site A and Site B context and output progression plus narrator input/output in the DAG, and record whether causal explanation, unsupported environmental continuation, repetition, latency, privacy and authority improve. Retain surviving phenomena without inserting unrelated fixes."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_STABILIZE_AGENT_ACTION_CONTRACT NARRATOR_INPUT_TRIAL_COMPLETED -> AGENT_ACTION_CONTRACT_ACCEPTED:
  title "Stabilize and expose the character action-proposal contract"
  description "Use OBS-20260807-04 and retained Site A and Site B traces as the current pipeline axis. Keep the model proposal distinct from server validation and the accepted following-turn action. Constrain proposals to the supplied available actions affordances and opportunity chains, retain an explicit bounded acceptance or rejection reason without hidden facts or raw transport data, and preserve safe previous-state fallback. Add focused tests for valid skill basic defend and free-action proposals plus invalid target skill instrument finisher and affordance cases. Do not add standalone narrator wording work or broaden mechanical authority."
  duration 2p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_TRY_AGENT_ACTION_CONTRACT AGENT_ACTION_CONTRACT_ACCEPTED -> AGENT_ACTION_CONTRACT_TRIAL_COMPLETED:
  title "Release and observe the character action-proposal contract"
  description "Run full local acceptance then release the exact artifact through feature review annotated tag Stage and protected Promote. Execute the persistent cross-account E2E battle and compare accepted rejected and skipped Site A and Site B proposals against the v0.10.0 baseline of 22 rejected side-turns out of 30. Inspect action diversity causal grounding fallback privacy latency and downstream narration only as an observation lens. Retain surviving phenomena without an interrupting narrator-only patch."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_SELECT_FOLLOWING_PIPELINE_AXIS AGENT_ACTION_CONTRACT_TRIAL_COMPLETED -> FOLLOWING_PIPELINE_AXIS_SELECTED:
  title "Select the next pipeline axis from the new observation"
  description "Rank continuation of the action-proposal boundary against environment world-process and adaptive expanded-adjudication axes using retained production frequency reproducibility canonical-authority risk cross-stage user value and current-main patchability. The v0.11.0 observation selects one bounded action-kind-specific output-shape alignment and production retry first because all 15 invoked proposals were fulfilled but schema-invalid. Non-critical narrator observations remain pending scorecards; include one only when the selected slice shares its input or authority cause. Record the selected task and point estimate before implementation starts."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_ALIGN_AGENT_ACTION_PROPOSAL_SHAPE FOLLOWING_PIPELINE_AXIS_SELECTED -> AGENT_ACTION_PROPOSAL_SHAPE_ALIGNED:
  title "Align character-agent proposal output with action-kind contracts"
  description "Make the provider prompt express action proposals as explicit action-kind-specific JSON variants so skill basic attack defend rest and wait omit free-action-only explanation and subject fields while free action keeps its grounded attempt fields. Preserve the server validator raw bounded proposal receipt character state and speech mechanical authority and narrator policy. Add focused prompt-contract regression coverage; do not add a narrator guard or environment mechanics."
  duration 1p
  status done
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

task T_TRY_ALIGNED_AGENT_ACTION_PROPOSALS AGENT_ACTION_PROPOSAL_SHAPE_ALIGNED -> AGENT_ACTION_PROPOSAL_ALIGNMENT_TRIAL_COMPLETED:
  title "Release and observe aligned character action proposals"
  description "Release the prompt-only contract alignment through the protected path and run the persistent production E2E battle. Compare proposal acceptance and rejection reasons against the v0.11.0 baseline of 15 schema-invalid proposals out of 15 invoked lanes. Use the retained result to choose environment world-process or adaptive expanded adjudication next; keep non-critical narrator symptoms pending except for incidental improvement caused by accepted action diversity."
  duration 1p
  owner "codex"
  requires:
    DEV 1

